* '''Football:''' the city has two teams playing football in Super League, the Swiss top tier. Both [https://www.fcz.ch/ FC Zürich] and [https://www.gcz.ch/ Grasshoppers] play at Letzigrund, capacity 26,000, at 500 Badenerstrasse, 1 km west of the main railway station. In 2025 it hosted matches in the UEFA Women's Euro Finals. 
