The restaurants at the top of the '''Uetliberg''' are great to combine a nice view of town (a hike in the summer) and some great food. It also has a cheaper self-service area.

==Drink==

Zurich has a lot of places to go out. There are a lot of clubs, restaurants, ''cafés'', bars but also many museums and theatres. Few of them are particularly wild, but there are certainly many options. The most common drinks in Zurich include: Beer, Swiss white wine (e.g. Fendant), Swiss red wine (is delicious), and Spanish red wine (is generally good value here). At ''apéro'' time (after work), you will find many people drinking a ''Cüpli'' (glass of sparkling wine).Tap water in the city is of high quality and safe to drink. Bring a reusable bottle to save money and reduce plastic waste.

